  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to adelphi global gemeinn&#xfc;tzige GmbH (adelphi) 2024-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Danish core contribution will be used to enable adelphi&#x2019;s core activities of field research, advocacy, and policy engagement and outreach. This will contribute to the development of knowledge products and operational guidance on the interlinkages between climate and security with a view to preventing, resolving, and mitigating conflict through informing and influencing the perceptions and actions of policymakers and other key actors in fragile settings. From a thematic perspective, this can include question like early warning, climate change adaptation or climate-related migration management and displacement prevention and can be expanded to questions of natural resource management, including water and livelihoods. A regional focus will be on fragile and conflict prone countries in Africa (for example, specific geographic contexts in the Sahel and/or the Horn of Africa).</narrative>
  </description>
